<poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">

  <!-- Header Section -->
  <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-0.png" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
  <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-1.png" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

  <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-1-images">
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-6.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-8.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      May month is the stepping stone <br />
      into Summer from the Spring. <br />
      Covering trees with fragrant blossom <br />
      and feathered friends are on the wing.
    </p>

    <p>
      Time to hang up overcoat and scarf <br />
      get outside now and explore. <br />
      There is a wealth of interest there <br />
      Lying right outside your front door.
    </p>

    <p>
      Butterflies look as if they are dancing <br />
      to the humming of the bumble bees. <br />
      The birds are all singing their dawn <br />
      chorus
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
  <div slot="col-3-images">
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-2.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-3.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-4.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 4 Text -->
  <div slot="col-4-text">
    <p>
      that wafts on the sweet perfumed breeze . <br />
      Bulbs are bursting into flower <br />
      showing many different kinds of hue. <br />
      It is nature's free gift to everyone
    </p>

    <p>
      a real Spring tonic for me and you. <br />
      From this modern hectic lifestyle now <br />
      Stop! and linger - then take note <br />
      of the beauty all around you here
    </p>

    <p>
      in your own special little spot. <br />
      You'll feel the tension in your body ease <br />
      refreshed and happy ready for the day <br />
      as you find out life can be quite sweet
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-5-images">
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-5.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-7.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/may-poem-by-eila-webster/image-9.png" alt="" />
  </div>

</poem-grid>
